    {
      "text": "A brochure page for the NUS MTech in Artificial Intelligence Systems. The upper half covers English Language Proficiency (TOEFL and IELTS thresholds in a small table) and the GRE/NUS-ISS entrance test, with a \"How to Apply\" panel. The lower half holds the Programme Schedule as two coloured grids -- full-time over two semesters, part-time over four -- followed by notes on the Practice Module and the Stackable Graduate Certificate Programme.",
